     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking the price",
     "texto": [
      "**Cât costă bluza?** means «How much does the blouse cost?». The answer can be **Bluza costă douăzeci de lei** («The blouse costs twenty lei»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Colour and agreement",
     "texto": [
      "Unlike in English, colours also agree with the garment: **un tricou albastru**, **o bluză albastră**, **pantofi albaștri**, **rochii albastre**. **Verde** has the same form in the singular, and **verzi** in the plural."
     ],
